        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>摄影常用工具学习</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .container {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f2f9f2 0%, #f2f9f2 100%);\n    background-color: #eef8ee;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 10px 20px 25px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    color: #e02020;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .num {\n    flex: 0 0 22px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #222;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .content {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .title-line {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .title-line u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .desc-line {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #2b5fc4;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"header\">画红线的是在我们摄影当中常用的工具可以着重学习</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">①</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>移动工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>画板工具</u>（V）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">移动选取或画面主题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">②</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>套索工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>多边形套索工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>磁性套索</u>（L）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">创建手绘选取</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">③</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>裁剪工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>透视裁剪工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>切片工具</u>（C）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">裁剪或扩展画面边缘</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">④</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>修补工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>污点修复画笔工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>修补工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>内容感知移动工具</u>（J）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">去除瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑤</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>仿制图章工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>图案图章工具</u>（S）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">磨皮去瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑥</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>橡皮擦工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>背景橡皮擦工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>魔术橡皮擦工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;（E）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">擦除画面，经常结合蒙版使用</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑦</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>锐化工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>模糊工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>涂抹工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;锐化图像中的柔边</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">锐化图像柔边</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑧</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>钢笔工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>自由钢笔工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>弯度钢笔工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>添加描点工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>删除描点工具</u><br><u>删除描点工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>转换点工具</u>（P）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">抠图常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑨</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>路径选择工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>直接选择工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;（A）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">选择抠图路径一般结合钢笔工具使用</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑩</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>抓手工具</u>（H）或（<u>空格</u>）&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>旋转视图工具</u>（R）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">拖动整个图像的工具</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑪</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>矩形选框工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>椭圆选框工具</u>（M）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">创建矩形或圆形选取</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"num\">⑫</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><u>快速选择工具</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>魔棒工具</u>（W）</div>\n      <div class=\"desc-line\">选择色彩类似的图像区域</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
